    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is"
